## Multiple Sequence Alignment (MSA)

The TP53 protein query sequence (**NP_000537.3**) and the selected homologous protein sequences retrieved from the BLASTp analysis were imported into **MEGA 12** for multiple sequence alignment. The alignment was performed using the **ClustalW** algorithm to identify conserved regions and sequence variations among the TP53 proteins. The resulting alignment was used as the input for phylogenetic tree construction.
